SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEWEB:https://www.jessejackjones.com

###Block: Epic Channeling Feats

Absolute Channel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=29	PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=FEAT,Alignment Channel,Elemental Channel	DESC:You can affect undead, elementals, and outsiders simultaneously when channeling energy.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.41
Bolster the Faithful	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,CHA=18	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Selective Channeling	DESC:When channeling energy, you can designate specific targets to be affected or excluded.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.41
Colloquy of Nostrum	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Word of Panacea	DESC:When you channel positive energy, you also add the effects of restoration to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.41
Divine Interposition	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Reach Spell	DESC:You can channel energy as a medium-range (100 ft. + 10 ft./level) 30-foot radius burst.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.41
Empower Channel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Empower Spell	DESC:Your channel energy damage or healing increases by 1d6.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.41
Enlarge Channel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	DESC:Your channel energy radius increases by 15 feet.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.42
Flesh and Bones	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:Your channel energy affects both living creatures and undead simultaneously.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.42
Heaven's Song	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=31	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Colloquy of Nostrum	DESC:When you channel positive energy, you also add the effects of greater restoration to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.42
Indomitable Channel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Channel	DESC:The save DC of your channel energy increases by 1.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.42
Instant Channel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=FEAT,Quick Channel,Quicken Spell	DESC:You can channel energy as a swift action or a move action.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.42
Light of Blessing	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	DESC:When you channel positive energy, you also add the effects of bless to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.42
Light of Faith	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Light of Blessing	DESC:When you channel positive energy, you also add the effects of prayer to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Light of Fervor	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Light of Faith	DESC:When you channel positive energy, you also add the effects of blessing of fervor to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Negative Energy Aura	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,CHA=23	DESC:You radiate a 15-foot aura of negative energy, dealing 1 point of damage per die of channel energy each round.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Overchannel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:When channeling positive energy, healing above a creature's maximum hit points becomes temporary hit points.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Perfect Channeler	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=31	PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=FEAT,Absolute Channel,Bolster the Faithful	DESC:Your channel energy uses d8s instead of d6s. You may also choose to maximize your channel energy.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Positive Energy Aura	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,CHA=23	DESC:You radiate a 15-foot aura of positive energy, healing 1 point per die of channel energy each round.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Presence of Fear	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	DESC:When you channel negative energy, you also add the effects of cause fear to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.43
Shadow of Night	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Presence of Fear	DESC:When you channel negative energy, you also add the effects of blindness to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Spectral Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=19	DESC:After channeling positive energy, your attacks deal damage normally against incorporeal creatures for one round.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Widen Channel	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Widen Spell	DESC:Your channel energy radius increases by 15 feet.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Winds of Agony	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Shadow of Night	DESC:When you channel negative energy, you also add the effects of terrible remorse to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Wings of Fire	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,CHA=25	DESC:By expending a use of channel negative energy, you transform and gain fiery wings with fly speed 90, fire immunity, and other benefits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Wings of Light	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,CHA=25	DESC:By expending a use of channel positive energy, you transform and gain luminous wings with fly speed 90, light-based immunities, and other benefits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Word of Panacea	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Channeling	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:When you channel positive energy, you also add the effects of lesser restoration to affected targets.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
